    </content>
    <glossary>
    <definition id="def-00001"><term>food desert</term><meaning>geographic area where fresh food is not readily available</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00002"><term>macronutrients</term><meaning>nutrient-rich carbohydrates, proteins, and fats needed for energy</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00003"><term>night terrors</term><meaning>intense fear or terror that occurs during deep sleep</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00004"><term>stunting</term><meaning>impaired growth in height, often due to malnutrition</meaning></definition>
    </glossary>
</document>